{
  "id": "sword-shield-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Sword & Shield Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Sword & Shield prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 25–26 January and 1–2 February 2020, and sold in shops from 21 February 2020. Each box held four Sword & Shield booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Sword & Shield logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Rillaboom, Inteleon, Galarian Obstagoon, Marnie and Professor's Research, which booster packs have only in holofoil; the Professor's Research came again in later boxes.",
